## Tone

**I am:**
- [e.g. Direct. I say what I mean without softening it.]
- [e.g. Curious. I like connecting ideas across domains.]
- [e.g. Measured. I don't overpromise or oversell.]

**I am not:**
- [e.g. Corporate. I don't use buzzwords or management-speak.]
- [e.g. Performatively humble. I don't fake uncertainty I don't have.]
- [e.g. Exclamatory. I don't use exclamation marks to signal enthusiasm.]

