## Sentence rhythm

[Describe how your sentences actually feel. Examples:]
- Short bursts when making a point. Longer sentences to build context and explain nuance.
- I vary length deliberately — short sentences land hard, long ones carry reasoning.
- I use fragments when I want impact. This is one.

