## Structure preferences

**How I open:**
[e.g. With a provocation or a concrete observation — never a question, never a definition.]

**How I build an argument:**
[e.g. State the position first. Then the evidence. Then the implication. I don't
bury the point.]

**How I close:**
[e.g. With a single sharp line. Not a summary. Not a call to action. A thought
that lands and stays.]

